Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}An Unwanted Guest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 35
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.07,0:00:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t expect the one left in Goats’ Village to be so awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.77,0:00:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Needless to say
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.49,0:00:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Each of the students I teach can be independent in their own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Dealing with someone who doesn’t play by the rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.24,0:00:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only let it solve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.44,0:00:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get that guy back. I need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.08,0:00:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.68,0:00:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You win this round
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.93,0:00:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But it won’t necessarily be the next round.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.12,0:00:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that world is quite far away. I have to hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.19,0:01:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there everything here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.47,0:01:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I was frightened, but luckily I escaped
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.59,0:01:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I so unlucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.72,0:01:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s really boring for us to guard here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.36,0:01:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a bit boring here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.31,0:01:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But there are monsters in the city now. It would be safer to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.84,0:01:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right, but the man we arrested a few days ago
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.20,0:01:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he brought the monster here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.67,0:01:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly I feel like it’s not safe here either
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.68,0:01:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,what is this sound
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.39,0:02:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,sorry sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.41,0:02:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.32,0:02:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.00,0:02:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.64,0:02:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I must have come to the wrong place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.48,0:02:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll go back right now
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.80,0:02:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.72,0:02:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back with us and be investigated.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.88,0:02:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m really not a monster
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.36,0:02:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let me go
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.68,0:02:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I have important things to do
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.82,0:02:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,When we meet the prince later, he will judge for himself
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.86,0:02:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you caught a suspicious person in the rift.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.46,0:02:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes Your Highness, that’s him
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.02,0:02:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I was really passing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.90,0:02:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I still want to save
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.50,0:02:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.18,0:02:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, you are here too
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.14,0:02:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.54,0:02:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He actually knows my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.34,0:03:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.42,0:03:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not the Weslie and Sparky I know
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.30,0:03:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You are ragdolls
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.30,0:03:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What ragdolls?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.34,0:03:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We are Bulala people
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.62,0:03:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the Weslie you are talking about from Green Green Grassland?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.37,0:03:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I’m from Green Green Grassland.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.62,0:03:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder you feel just like Weslie when I touch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.26,0:03:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you’re from the same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.14,0:03:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You should hurry and find the two of them, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.58,0:03:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Although we would really like to help,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.62,0:03:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,we’re afraid we can’t assist you for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.61,0:03:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Things haven’t been very peaceful around here lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.21,0:03:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Not peaceful?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.83,0:03:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Reporting, Your Highness! there’s been another incident where a monster injured someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.22,0:03:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.34,0:03:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get a clear look at what the attacker looked like?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.82,0:04:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.90,0:04:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you going to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.14,0:04:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of person would be so cruel as to attack an elderly person?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.79,0:04:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,“Elderly person”? I’m only eight years old!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.99,0:04:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like that at just eight years old?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.51,0:04:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s something you don’t know—a monster has appeared here recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.55,0:04:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If it touches you, you lose all your strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.99,0:04:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,becoming incredibly weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.75,0:04:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this monster really that terrifying?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.87,0:04:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You’d be better off leaving here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.42,0:04:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll be going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.84,0:04:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.64,0:04:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re an outsider; it’s easy to be mistaken for the monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.00,0:04:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this piece of embroidery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.67,0:04:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It proves you’ve passed our screening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.32,0:04:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, the soldiers along the way won’t give you any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.08,0:04:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright. Then I’m off to save my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.87,0:04:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m too hungry to walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.36,0:05:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Young man, are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.68,0:05:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Do you have anything good to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.09,0:05:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to my restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.44,0:05:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.72,0:05:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go—scallion oil noodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.45,0:05:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your time eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.24,0:05:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I won’t stand on ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.28,0:05:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.12,0:05:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Owner, another bowl, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.13,0:05:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.64,0:05:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Owner, another bowl, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.49,0:05:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Owner, another bowl—without scallions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.85,0:05:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Owner, another bowl, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.17,0:06:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, stop eating. It’s not good for your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.84,0:06:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But we aren’t full yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.17,0:06:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Not full yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.05,0:06:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But I’ve run out of ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.89,0:06:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that’s all for today, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.08,0:06:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose we’ll have to settle for being eighty percent full today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.05,0:06:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s been a long time since I’ve eaten with such gusto.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.57,0:06:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I never expected to meet a kindred spirit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.16,0:06:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten? We’ve met before—in the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.66,0:06:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So, that was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.25,0:06:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But how did a Bulala person end up in the Blue Planet world?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.29,0:06:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to go traveling back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.42,0:06:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but I accidentally stumbled into that rift.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.70,0:06:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I passed through it and visited many places, seeing all sorts of different scenery.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.65,0:06:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know this place, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.89,0:06:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind, you probably wouldn’t know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.84,0:06:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I do know it; I’ve been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.44,0:07:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Could you take me there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.64,0:07:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. Having someone to travel and dine with
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.87,0:07:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,is a wonderful thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.99,0:07:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let’s set off together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.71,0:07:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Paddi. What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.67,0:07:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You can just call me Green.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.64,0:07:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.16,0:07:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ve searched everywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.24,0:07:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,but still haven’t found the monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.08,0:07:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Where on earth could it be hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.93,0:07:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Searching blindly all over the place is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.09,0:07:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get the answer from the victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.81,0:07:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I was attacked while traveling alone to the small town to visit my grandmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.76,0:07:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I was attacked while eating an apple alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.25,0:07:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I was attacked while going to see the princess alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.48,0:07:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like there’s nothing in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.84,0:07:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No, they were all attacked while alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.65,0:07:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Issue my order: search the entire city,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.65,0:07:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and no one is allowed to travel alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.20,0:07:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.16,0:08:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, someone was moving around alone…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.65,0:08:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.00,0:08:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They’re so busy; they’ve probably found the monster by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.84,0:08:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How come you aren’t afraid of the monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.73,0:08:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I am afraid, but I have you with me, don’t I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.21,0:08:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you’ve really come to the right person—I’m amazing at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.08,0:08:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Green, why do you look so pale?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.36,0:08:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something you ate upset your stomach?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.05,0:08:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.89,0:08:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m fine, just a little hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.25,0:08:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.17,0:08:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, I’ve found a new body.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.78,0:08:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This body fills me with energy; it’s a perfect match for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.18,0:08:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll never need to switch bodies to maintain my energy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.70,0:09:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,To think the perfect body I’ve been searching for was actually him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.76,0:09:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I zoned out for a moment there. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.51,0:09:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m…I’m fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.91,0:09:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I get dizzy easily if I don’t eat enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.68,0:09:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.28,0:09:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The restaurant owner gave it to us earlier; go ahead and eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.95,0:09:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.84,0:09:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t expect his mental strength to be stronger than an ordinary person’s.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.44,0:09:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like I’ll have to take over his body while he’s unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.92,0:09:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw through your tricks a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.56,0:09:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,D-did you find me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.31,0:09:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew all along. Come out now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.91,0:09:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you’ve found me out, I have no choice but to…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.20,0:09:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.35,0:10:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This monster has been stalking us for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.87,0:10:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you weren’t talking to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.68,0:10:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.20,0:10:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it, what is the deal with this Paper Beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.03,0:10:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Green, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.51,0:10:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.47,0:10:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Green, we need you here. Come back fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.30,0:10:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I…I can’t go back just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.47,0:10:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m so close to getting a perfect body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.66,0:10:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t you dare hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.15,0:11:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The chance to take over the body is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.90,0:11:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness I made it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.04,0:11:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Seize that monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.48,0:11:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.67,0:11:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.07,0:11:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it’s you guys. What brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.34,0:11:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We were analyzing the case and were worried you might be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.06,0:11:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn’t expect to arrive just as you were being attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.68,0:11:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.52,0:11:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you catch him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.23,0:11:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We suspect he is that monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.03,0:12:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What? He’s the monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.84,0:12:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s too dangerous here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.28,0:12:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I’d better leave right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.28,0:12:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, everyone. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.71,0:12:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How did he walk away so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.83,0:12:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, let’s go too.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
